   "actor": "ye",
   "file": "voice/tts_L026.wav",
   "subtitle": "雪小姐是商会的人，为什么会亲自跑这么远的路？",
   "duration": 7.609999999999999,
   "t": 308.77
  },
  {
   "type": "camera",
   "name": "xue_close",
   "transition": 0.8,
   "t": 316.18
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "xue",
   "file": "voice/tts_L027.wav",
   "subtitle": "这批货里，有一封要紧的信。要亲手交给望风塔的塔主。",
   "duration": 7.4799999999999995,
   "t": 316.18
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "xue",
   "file": "voice/tts_L028.wav",
   "subtitle": "信里写了什么，我也不知道。只知道，很多人都在等着它。",
   "duration": 7.84,
   "t": 323.46
  },
  {
   "type": "camera",
   "name": "feng_close",
   "transition": 0.8,
   "t": 331.1
  },
  {
   "type": "anim",
   "actor": "feng",
   "anim": "avatar_nyanya",
   "t": 331.1
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "feng",
   "file": "voice/tts_L029.wav",
   "subtitle": "神秘！我最喜欢神秘的东西了！写书的时候一定用它当开头！",
   "duration": 6.9799999999999995,
   "t": 331.1
  },
  {
   "type": "camera",
   "name": "three_shot",
   "transition": 0.8,
   "t": 337.88
  },
  {
   "type": "anim",
   "actor": "ye",
   "anim": "avatar_no_head",
   "t": 337.88
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "ye",
   "file": "voice/tts_L030.wav",
   "subtitle": "……你的『最喜欢』，多半会让我们绕远路。",
   "duration": 5.97,
   "t": 337.88
  },
  {
   "type": "anim",
   "actor": "feng",
   "anim": "avatar_express_embarrased",
   "t": 343.65
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "feng",
   "file": "voice/tts_L031.wav",
   "subtitle": "哎呀，上次绕远路那只是意外啦！",
   "duration": 3.92,
   "t": 343.65
  },
  {
   "type": "camera",
   "name": "xue_close",
   "transition": 0.8,
   "t": 347.37
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "xue",
   "file": "voice/tts_L032.wav",
   "subtitle": "我的家乡在海边。出发前，母亲替我缝了这件衣服的领口。",
   "duration": 7.77,
   "t": 347.37
  },
  {
   "type": "anim",
   "actor": "xue",
   "anim": "avatar_express_afraid",
   "t": 354.94
  },
  {
   "type": "voice",
   "actor": "xue",
   "file": "voice/tts_L033.wav",
   "subtitle": "她说，路上的风大。其实我知道，她是舍不得。",
   "duration": 6.949999999999999,
   "t": 354.94
  },
  {
   "type": "camera",
   "name": "three_shot",
   "transition": 0.9,
   "t": 362.69
  },
  {
   "type": "subtitle",
   "text": "火光映在三张年轻的脸上。夜色，一点点落了下来。",
   "t": 362.69
  },
  {
   "type": "environment",
   "preset": "night",
